  ('cc020006-e031-4000-8000-000000000031', 'cc020006-0006-0006-0006-000000000006', 'prin____', 'The complete word is "printing".', 'medium', 31, 'complete_words', 'Questions 31–40: Complete the Words', 'ting', '{"instruction":"Fill in the missing letters in the paragraph.","template":"The invention of the printing press changed how knowledge spread across Europe. Before {{1}}, each {{2}} had {{3}} be {{4}} by {{5}}, which {{6}} months {{7}} made {{8}} extremely {{9}}. Printed {{10}} were cheaper and could be produced in large numbers. As a result, more people learned to read, and new ideas travelled quickly from one country to another. Scholars could now compare the same text in different cities, which made errors easier to find and correct.","prefix":"prin","missing":4}'::jsonb),
